      "description": "Simplify your digital life with Unora!\nSay goodbye to the chaos of constantly switching between multiple apps. Unora brings together your emails, messages from WhatsApp, Instagram, Snapchat, Slack, Gmail and Discord in one easy-to-use app. Become the organized person you've always wanted to be with features like filtering, color-coding, and mailing lists.\n\nCOMMUNICATION\nUnora is a universal messaging app that displays chats and emails from multiple chat platforms in one interface. It supports apps like Instagram, WhatsApp, Gmail and 4 other platforms, allowing you to send and reply to messages without having to switch between apps. \n\nFILTERING \nThe app offers organized features such as filtering, mailing lists and color coding. Unora allows for a user-friendly design that promotes simplicity and efficiency. \n\nMAILING LISTS\nDo you have an email inbox filled with advertisements and newsletters where the important emails get lost? With Unora you can see a clear and unified list of all newsletters from your linked email account. In the same list you can also unsubscribe with one click!\n\nUnora is compatible with iPhone devices with iOS 18.0 or newer.\n\n\nMore information can be found at https://unora.se/\n\nTerms of Service: https://unora.se/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://unora.se/privacy",
